    "projection": "Produces XML; source SHA identity is intact, but projection generation alone does not qualify native loading.",
    "independent_verify": "engine.load fails; dependent gates remain failed rather than fabricating native facts.",
    "teleop_native_worker": "Consumes the same entry and mesh bytes; fails before ready without an encoding adaptation.",
    "browser": "Consumes native compiled geometry and cannot receive a model until native loading succeeds.",
    "recording_verifier": "Reloads native source; receives the same engine input restriction."
  },
  "policy": "Do not alter native/manual source, decimate, patch a robot name, skip independent verification, or bind the offline diagnostic to a production run. Authority converter and independent Verify must be designed together.",
